    },
    {
      "id": "claim_12a19b1dd96544cea8a176d97e4110af",
      "statement": "Prompts compose via the + operator, which concatenates messages (for ChatPromptTemplate) or templates (for PromptTemplate), merging input variables and partial variables. Conflicting partial variable keys raise validation errors.",
